# The hangar, quickly: circle past the logo, circle past the intro, START,
# START, cross on OPTION. Lands on the option menu with the Caution box up
# and the 3D hangar rendering behind it.
#
# This is the frame to compare against a PPSSPP reference: there the hangar
# is a lit grey room, here it is nearly black. The shaded vertex colour and
# the textures are both right (findings item 31); what is missing is in the
# compositing passes.
#
# Recorded by Sif, 2 Sep. 383 polls of input against new-game.pad's 6,000 --
# roughly a minute a run instead of several, which is the difference between
# measuring a blend rule once and measuring it twenty times.
#
#   scripts/09-replay.sh --decode --env PSPRECOMP_FRAME=reports/hangar.ppm \
#                        scenarios/hanger.pad
#
# Pair it with title-idle.pad, as new-game.pad is: a run that goes a similar
# distance and presses nothing is what makes a difference here mean anything.

drain 60

@87     state circle 128 128   # t=3.500s
@91     state none 128 128   # t=3.623s
@161    state circle 128 128   # t=6.816s
@163    state none 128 128   # t=6.915s
@271    state start 128 128   # t=11.218s
@273    state none 128 128   # t=11.328s
@293    state start 128 128   # t=12.358s
@294    state none 128 128   # t=12.413s
@316    state cross 128 128   # t=13.540s
@318    state none 128 128   # t=13.648s

@420   mark "option menu, caution box up"
@430   stop
